# The pre-rename binary name (TRANSCODE-12). Kept ignored deliberately: renaming this
# entry instead of adding to it un-ignored a stale ./transcode from an earlier build,
# and a blanket `git add` swept an 18MB binary into the commit. A blob in git history
# outlives a tag. Leave both.
/transcode
# The e2e fixture server, built at the repository root by a plain `go build
# ./internal/webui/e2e/fixtureserver`. Ignored for the same reason the two above are: a
# blanket `git add` sweeps an 8MB ELF into a commit, and a blob in git history outlives
# the branch that carried it.
/fixtureserver
/dist/
/out/

